Warzone Mobile Offline – Godot Web Port
This project is an experimental Godot Engine port of my offline Warzone Mobile project. It uses the same locally extracted game assets and has been adapted to run directly in a modern web browser.

The goal is to preserve and explore the game’s maps, modes and gameplay in a standalone environment without depending on the original online services. The current build focuses on local gameplay, offline bots and browser compatibility.
Features

- Playable directly in a web browser
- Built with Godot Engine
- Uses the assets from the original Warzone game
- Offline local gameplay
- Bot support
- No connection to the original game servers required

Keybinds
Press V to enable third person
Press K to fly
Press M to open the minimap

Project Status
This project is still under development. Some maps, textures, menus, shaders, audio and gameplay systems may be incomplete or behave differently from the original mobile version. Performance depends on the browser, operating system and graphics hardware.

